  m_text: '14th-century wall painting from Oystermouth Castle Chapel confession spot.


    Two
    angels flank the devotional space, with de Braose heraldic shields below representing
    the family''s patronage.


    Based on pigment analysis (Paine & Stewart, 2018)
    and historical documentation (Hughes, 2024).'
